@page "/"
<PageTitle>Privacy Policy - HydroTrack</PageTitle>

<div class="privacy-container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>HydroTrack</strong>, built by Androma Galaxy Games Studio. We believe in absolute privacy. Our app is designed to help you track your hydration offline, with zero invasive tracking.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>2. Data Collection & Storage</h2>
        <p>HydroTrack operates on an <strong>Offline-First</strong> basis. All of your personal health data (including Name, Height, Weight, and Water Logs) is stored entirely locally on your device's internal SQLite database. We do not sell, rent, or share your health data with any third parties.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>3. Anonymous Crash Reporting</h2>
        <p>To improve app stability, we collect anonymous crash logs. This data contains a randomly generated 8-character ID, your device model (e.g., Pixel 7), and the error message. It contains absolutely zero Personally Identifiable Information (PII) or health data.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>4. Cloud Sync (Future Features)</h2>
        <p>If you choose to use our upcoming cross-device Cloud Sync feature, your data will be securely transmitted and stored in our encrypted Supabase database, linked only to your anonymous ID.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
        <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> support@andromagalaxygames.com</p>
    </div>
</div>

